[I] Bash scripts used to monitor system log files for anomalies

[T] logcheck is a set of shell scripts that periodically scans system log
[T] files for security violations and unusual activity, filters known
[T] harmless messages and mails the remaining entries to the administrator.

[U] https://packages.debian.org/source/sid/logcheck

[A] Logcheck Authors
